    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "refersTo";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Reference to the Health Secretary";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(1) This item applies to an instrument if: (a) the instrument was made under the old NHS Act; and (b) the instrument was in force immediately before the transition time; and (c) the instrument contains a reference to the Health Secretary.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "(2) The instrument has effect, at and after the transition time, as if a reference in the instrument to the Health Secretary were a reference to the Director-General of the CDC.";
